<style>
  .md-designer-shell {
    --md-accent: #1ab394;
    --md-ink: #243648;
    --md-soft: #728290;
    --md-border: #deebf3;
    --md-surface: #ffffff;
  }

  .md-designer-shell .md-designer-card {
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--md-border);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(19, 35, 52, 0.08);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .md-designer-shell .ibox-title {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--md-border);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbfd 0%, #f2f7fb 100%);
    padding: 15px 16px;
  }

  .md-designer-shell .ibox-content {
    background: var(--md-surface);
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .md-designer-toolbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .md-designer-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .md-designer-actions .btn {
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .md-designer-shell .nav-tabs > li > a {
    border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #4c6072;
  }

  .md-designer-shell .nav-tabs > li.active > a,
  .md-designer-shell .nav-tabs > li.active > a:hover {
    color: var(--md-ink);
    border-color: var(--md-border) var(--md-border) transparent;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .md-tab-pane {
    padding-top: 12px;
  }

  .md-section-note {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--md-soft);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .md-designer-shell .table > thead > tr > th {
    background: #f7fafc;
  }

  .md-side-overlay {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    z-index: 999998;
    display: none;
  }

  .md-side-overlay.is-open {
    display: block;
  }

  .md-side-panel {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    right: -560px;
    width: 560px;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: 100vh;
    background: #fff;
    z-index: 999999;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--md-border);
    box-shadow: -8px 0 24px rgba(19, 35, 52, 0.18);
    transition: right .2s ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .md-side-panel.is-open {
    right: 0;
  }

  .md-side-header {
    padding: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--md-border);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f9fcfe 0%, #f2f7fb 100%);
  }

  .md-side-body {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 14px;
  }

  .md-side-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--md-border);
    padding: 14px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .md-form-preview {
    min-height: 160px;
    border: 1px dashed #c8d7e2;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fbfdff 0%, #f5f9fc 100%);
  }
</style>

<div class="row animated fadeInRight md-designer-shell" style="margin-top:10px;">
  <div class="col-lg-12">
    <div class="ibox md-designer-card">
      <div class="ibox-title">
        <h5 id="mdDesignerTitle">Metadata Designer</h5>
      </div>
      <div class="ibox-content">
        <div class="md-designer-toolbar">
          <div class="md-designer-actions">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="btnMdSaveDraft">
              <i class="fa fa-save"></i> Salvar rascunho
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-success btn-sm" id="btnMdPublishEntity">
              <i class="fa fa-bullhorn"></i> Publicar
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="md-designer-actions">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-white btn-sm" id="btnMdBack">
              <i class="fa fa-arrow-left"></i> Voltar
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="nav nav-tabs">
          <li class="active"><a href="#md-tab-fields" data-toggle="tab">Campos</a></li>
          <li><a href="#md-tab-relationships" data-toggle="tab">Relacionamentos</a></li>
          <li><a href="#md-tab-forms" data-toggle="tab">Formulários</a></li>
          <li><a href="#md-tab-security" data-toggle="tab">Segurança de Campos</a></li>
          <li><a href="#md-tab-history" data-toggle="tab">Histórico</a></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="tab-content">
          <div class="tab-pane active md-tab-pane" id="md-tab-fields">
            <div class="md-section-note">Campos ativos da entidade e ações de edição/publicação.</div>
            <div class="md-designer-actions" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="btnMdNewField">
                <i class="fa fa-plus"></i> Novo Campo
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="table-responsive">
              <table class="table table-striped table-bordered">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Display Name</th>
                    <th>Nome interno</th>
                    <th>Tipo</th>
                    <th>Required</th>
                    <th>Unique</th>
                    <th>Origem</th>
                    <th style="width:170px;">Ações</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="mdFieldsBody">
                  <tr><td colspan="7" class="text-center">Carregando...</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tab-pane md-tab-pane" id="md-tab-relationships">
            <div class="alert alert-info">
              Relacionamentos são configurados via campos do tipo <strong>LOOKUP</strong>.
              Também exibimos relações inferidas para campos UUID terminados em <code>_id</code>.
            </div>
            <div class="table-responsive">
              <table class="table table-striped table-bordered">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Campo</th>
                    <th>Tabela destino</th>
                    <th>On Delete</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="mdRelationshipsBody">
                  <tr><td colspan="3" class="text-center">Carregando...</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tab-pane md-tab-pane" id="md-tab-forms">
            <div class="md-section-note">Mantenha layouts separados para MAIN, QUICK_CREATE e SIDE_PANEL_CREATE.</div>
            <div class="md-designer-actions" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="btnMdNewForm">
                <i class="fa fa-plus"></i> Novo Formulário
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="table-responsive">
              <table class="table table-striped table-bordered">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Nome</th>
                    <th>Display Name</th>
                    <th>Tipo</th>
                    <th>Padrão</th>
                    <th>Versão draft</th>
                    <th>Versão publicada</th>
                    <th style="width:210px;">Ações</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="mdFormsBody">
                  <tr><td colspan="7" class="text-center">Carregando...</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <h5>Preview do layout</h5>
            <div class="md-form-preview" id="mdFormPreview">
              Selecione um formulário para visualizar o layout.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tab-pane md-tab-pane" id="md-tab-security">
            <div class="alert alert-info">
              Clique em um campo da aba <strong>Campos</strong> e use "Segurança" para editar regras por Role/User.
            </div>
            <div class="table-responsive">
              <table class="table table-striped table-bordered">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Campo</th>
                    <th>Regras</th>
                    <th style="width:150px;">Ações</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="mdSecuritySummaryBody">
                  <tr><td colspan="3" class="text-center">Carregando...</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tab-pane md-tab-pane" id="md-tab-history">
            <div class="table-responsive">
              <table class="table table-striped table-bordered">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Versão</th>
                    <th>Publicado em</th>
                    <th>Status</th>
                    <th>Migration</th>
                    <th>Erro</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="mdHistoryBody">
                  <tr><td colspan="5" class="text-center">Carregando...</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="md-side-overlay" id="mdSideOverlay"></div>
<div class="md-side-panel" id="mdSidePanel">
  <div class="md-side-header">
    <strong id="mdSideTitle">Editor</strong>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-xs btn-default" id="btnMdCloseSidePanel">Fechar</button>
  </div>
  <div class="md-side-body" id="mdSideBody"></div>
  <div class="md-side-footer">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="btnMdSaveSidePanel">Salvar</button>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  window.__metadataEntityId = "<%= metadataEntityId %>";
</script>
<script src="/js/admin/metadata-designer.designer.page.js"></script>
